        "title": "At a glance",
        "items": [
          "Common next steps are an MA, a B.Ed, a 3-year LLB, journalism, or an MBA.",
          "Many civil-services aspirants hold a BA, though any degree is eligible.",
          "A large share of students study by distance or open learning."
